# OCR Service - Mixed Documents Test Data
# This .gitignore file prevents binary document files from being committed to the repository
# to avoid repository bloat while ensuring configuration and documentation files are tracked.

# Exclude all document files by default
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.tiff
*.TIFF
*.tif
*.TIF
*.png
*.PNG
*.jpg
*.JPG
*.jpeg
*.JPEG

# Exclude any large binary files
*.bin
*.dat

# Exclude temporary files that might be created during testing
*.tmp
*~

# Track README and documentation files
!README.md
!DOCUMENT_SOURCES.md

# Track configuration files
!*.config.json
!*.metadata.json
!document_catalog.json

# Track sample document manifests
!manifest.json
!document_index.csv

# NOTE TO DEVELOPERS:
# Test documents should be obtained from the secure document storage at:
# s3://mca-documents-staging/test-documents/
#
# Run the download script from the project root to fetch test documents:
# ./scripts/fetch_test_documents.sh mixed_documents
#
# Contact the OCR team for access credentials if needed.